      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "tan(A+B) = 1 => A+B = 45°.",
      "hash": "3dc3909fb9939b85",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "यदि tan A = 1/2 और tan B = 1/3 है, तो (A+B) का मान ज्ञात कीजिये।",
          "options": {
            "A": "45°",
            "B": "30°",
            "C": "60°",
            "D": "90°"
          },
          "explanation": "tan(A+B) = (1/2 + 1/3) / (1 - 1/6) = (5/6) / (5/6) = 1. तो A+B = 45°."
        }
      }
    },
    {
